    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Salley Property Services are delighted to present No. 56 Cois Cualann to the market, an exceptional opportunity to acquire a stylish and beautifully maintained family home in one of South Dublin’s most convenient and sought-after residential locations. Occupying a superb position within a quiet cul-de-sac and overlooking a pleasant green area, this impressive three-bedroom semi-detached residence combines spacious accommodation, modern comforts and a superb coastal location, making it an ideal choice for families, first-time buyers and those seeking a home in turnkey condition..\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none. Cois Cualann is ideally positioned close to an excellent selection of schools, neighbourhood shopping, cafés, sports clubs and recreational amenities. Residents are within easy reach of Killiney Beach, Shankill Village, Dun Laoghaire, Cherrywood and the M50, while excellent public transport links ensure effortless commuting to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nPSRA Licence No 01288"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Internally, the property has been thoughtfully laid out and offers bright, generously proportioned living accommodation throughout. A welcoming entrance hall leads to a comfortable living room filled with natural light, while the kitchen and dining area provides an ideal space for both everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property boasts three well-appointed bedrooms together with a family bathroom, while the standout feature of this wonderful home is the substantial attic conversion complete with en-suite facilities, providing a versatile additional space perfectly suited as a principal suite, home office, guest accommodation, media room or playroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Key Features:\r\n• Exceptional 3-bedroom semi-detached family residence\r\n• Approx. 97 sq.m / 1,044 sq.ft\r\n• Superb attic conversion with en-suite\r\n• Quiet cul-de-sac setting\r\n• Overlooking green space\r\n• Bright, spacious and well-presented interiors\r\n• Turnkey condition throughout\r\n• Excellent schools, amenities and transport links nearby\r\n• Prime South Dublin coastal location\r\n• BER: C2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C2"
      },
