        "Content": "Next Opening Viewing 10th October between 10am - 10.30am. \r\n\r\nStrictly by appointment with Michael Salley on 085 765 5566 or Salley Property Services 01 2301902\r\n\r\n\r\nPSRA Licence No 01288"
